# Training samples are derived from Kaggle competition data: rebuild with `benchmark_services.py prepare`.
benchmark/*/samples/
# Downloaded 19th model bundles: fetch again from the run's results.
benchmark/*/models/
# Kaggle submission files (300k rows): regenerate with `nineteenth_workflow.py predict-test`.
benchmark/*/submissions/
# Keep the small result tables that back RESULTS.md (root ignores *.csv).
!benchmark/*/results/*.csv
# Holdout predictions: heart is small enough to keep; fraud (100k rows per size) is not.
!benchmark/heart/predictions/*.csv
# Cached seed-averaged classical holdout predictions: rebuilt by `compare`.
benchmark/*/cache/
# Tuned XGBoost parameters per training size (small, back RESULTS.md).
!benchmark/*/results/*.json
